{"id":"ban_era","lemma":"bañera","pos":"noun","rank":2972,"glosses":["bathtub, bath","cockpit","the bed of a dump truck"],"ipa":"/baˈɲeɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"bañeras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/25/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-ba%C3%B1era.wav","examples":[{"text":"El chico chapoteaba en la bañera.","en":"The boy splashed about in the tub.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687858","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"boy"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"¿Puedo usar mi portátil en la bañera?","en":"Can I use my laptop in the bath?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645568","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to use"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"portable"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"He llenado la bañera.","en":"I filled the tub.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/451106","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"to fill something up","l":"llenar"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"A él le gusta cantar en la bañera.","en":"He likes to sing in the bathtub.","words":[{"g":"to"},{"g":"he"},{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"to sing"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"La bañera rebosó mientras estaba al teléfono.","en":"The bathtub overflowed while she was talking on the phone.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/703836","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,null,{"g":"while, whilst, as"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"telephone"}]}]}